<title>USA: West Jefferson Amusement, Ala., yields 8.25 pct.</title>
<headline>West Jefferson Amusement, Ala., yields 8.25 pct.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-11-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Blount Parish &amp; Roton Inc said it priced $60 million of West Jefferson Amusement and Public Park Authority, Ala., first mortgage revenue bonds, Series 1996, with a top yield of 8.25 percent in 2026.</p>
